OL,3,APoundland unable to buy new stock as
OL,4,Afears over collapse grow
OL,5,
OL,6,FPoundland is unable to buy new stock to
OL,7,Ffill its shelves after being blocked by
OL,8,Fits owners from accessing cash in its
OL,9,Fbank accounts.
OL,11,FThe discount chain is on the brink of
OL,12,Fcollapse with one insider describing it
OL,13,Fas "running on fumes". It has until
OL,14,FThursday to secure a rescue deal.
OL,16,FAbout #50m has been frozen by its
OL,17,FAmerican owner Gordon Brothers, the BBC
OL,18,Funderstands, meaning its 600 shops are
OL,19,Frunning out of stock.
OL,23,APub: 09-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG7/39
