OL,3,ATurkey steel factory blast kills at
OL,4,Aleast 17 people
OL,5,
OL,6,FAt least 17 people have died and 12
OL,7,Fothers have been injured in an
OL,8,Fexplosion at an iron and steel factory
OL,9,Fnear the port city of Izmir in western
OL,10,FTurkey.
OL,12,FAll those killed and injured were
OL,13,Fworkers at the Habas Demir Celik plant
OL,14,Fin Aliaga, one of the country's leading
OL,15,Fsteel producers, authorities said.
OL,16,FFootage from the scene showed a large
OL,17,Ffire inside the facility and a towering
OL,18,Fcolumn of smoke rising into the air.
OL,23,APub: 09-NovQpppppppppppppppppppppG13/39
